{'symbol': 'GIS', 'date': '2022-01-18 12:00:00', 'title': 'GENERAL MILLS RECOMMENDS SHAREHOLDERS REJECT “MINI-TENDER” OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL INVESTMENT CORPORATION', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GENERAL MILLS (NYSE: GIS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT RECEIVED NOTICE OF AN UNSOLICITED “MINI-TENDER” OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL INVESTMENT CORPORATION (“TRC”) TO PURCHASE UP TO TWO MILLION SHARES OF GENERAL MILLS COMMON STOCK AT A PRICE OF $65.50 PER SHARE IN CASH. TRC'S OFFER PRICE IS 4.48% LESS THAN THE $68.57 CLOSING PRICE PER SHARE OF GENERAL MILLS' COMMON STOCK ON JANUARY 7, 2022, THE LAST TRADING DAY BEFORE THE MINI-TENDER OFFER COMMENCED. IF ALL SHARES ARE ACQUIRED,"}